      <div>
        <span>Hidden 1 → hidden 2</span>
        <strong>|w| = 0.12</strong>
        <small>63 connections</small>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>Hidden 2 → output</span>
        <strong>|w| = 0.28</strong>
        <small>21 connections</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="figure-note">Illustrative training path. The slider changes a deterministic mask rather than fitting a network from the paper's experiments. Hover over a connection to inspect its layer magnitude and resulting effective weight.</p>
